  {
   "text": "The wind on the chairlift stung Claire's cheeks, right between her goggles and her collar.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 5.139
  },
  {
   "text": "The fix: cover the gap. A balaclava covers head, face and neck in one piece.",
   "start": 5.389,
   "end": 10.386
  },
  {
   "text": "Hers looks like a grumpy grandpa.",
   "start": 10.686,
   "end": 12.37
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold day out.",
   "start": 12.67,
   "end": 14.825
  }
